    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1754183941\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tsukumogami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inanimate objects that gain consciousness after a long time. It's believed that they can sometimes take human form.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely candle suddenly inhabits a spirit: a beautiful and curvaceous woman. Stuck behind a locked door, she must find the key to unlock it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the ability to transform and slow down time, she uses her new body to escape the dangerous dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layers of Bust creates a zen yet adrenaline-filled experience. RNG is constantly changing patterns and outcomes, so each time you play will be different. Slow down time and stay alive as you collect points and power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/5142b40ca787430236aa22d5aad5ebf4.avif?t=1754183941\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge moving pillars in this top-down, never-ending, grid-based movement experience. Watch out for the bottomless pit, collapsing ground, and secret enemies <i>like cute ducks</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things will start to speed up, so sometimes you gotta slow down, literally. Slow down time to survive seemingly impossible circumstances, and grab a variety of power-ups to get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/c453adfed83bce1b41a8fcca630bca3f.avif?t=1754183941\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTAINS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, voluptuous girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large selection of outfits to wear. <i>(And take off.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades,\u00a0Challenges, Achievements and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of areas to play in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/1d3aa5884a78ed2af85535e350548f3c.avif?t=1754183941\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/425028e7c299b5cd18e5316457681cb7.avif?t=1754183941\" width=184 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tsukumogami</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inanimate objects that gain consciousness after a long time. It's believed that they can sometimes take human form.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lonely candle suddenly inhabits a spirit: a beautiful and curvaceous woman. Stuck behind a locked door, she must find the key to unlock it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the ability to transform and slow down time, she uses her new body to escape the dangerous dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Layers of Bust creates a zen yet adrenaline-filled experience. RNG is constantly changing patterns and outcomes, so each time you play will be different. Slow down time and stay alive as you collect points and power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/5142b40ca787430236aa22d5aad5ebf4.avif?t=1754183941\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge moving pillars in this top-down, never-ending, grid-based movement experience. Watch out for the bottomless pit, collapsing ground, and secret enemies <i>like cute ducks</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things will start to speed up, so sometimes you gotta slow down, literally. Slow down time to survive seemingly impossible circumstances, and grab a variety of power-ups to get the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/c453adfed83bce1b41a8fcca630bca3f.avif?t=1754183941\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CONTAINS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute, voluptuous girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fun story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large selection of outfits to wear. <i>(And take off.)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades,\u00a0Challenges, Achievements and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of areas to play in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772430/extras/1d3aa5884a78ed2af85535e350548f3c.avif?t=1754183941\" data-has-big width=800 height=80 /></span></p>",
